# Who may publish and subscribe where. Each device's MQTT username is its
# device id, so %u below is that id: a device can publish only under its own
# id. Anything not allowed here is refused. For QoS 0 the refusal is silent:
# the publisher sees no error and nobody receives the message.

# The coordinator reads every Briech topic and publishes nothing.
user coordinator
topic read briech/v1/#

# Every device (edge computer or tower adapter): its own three topics, write only.
pattern write briech/v1/edge/%u/detection
pattern write briech/v1/edge/%u/status
pattern write briech/v1/asset/%u/state
